  "conclusion_note_ohana_2024_appendix": "Every dataset in The Well's v1 release is either 2D or 3D on a structured grid, and every dataset either carries multiple physically coupled channels or is coupled through the geometry itself. Dropping channels or projecting to a line reproduces neither the residual nor the boundary conditions that PDELie's scalar-1D contract requires. This is a documented v1 result, not a solvable v0.32d gap.",
